OL,2,Wj5{5jj5s1FGARDAI SEIZE HEROIN
OL,3,W/*%/,$/..%,.%FWORTH #60,000
OL,4,G`````````````
OL,5,FGardai in Dublin say they have seized
OL,6,Fheroin with an estimated street value
OL,7,Fof #60,000.
OL,8,F
OL,9, The seizure was made at a house in
OL,10, Ballyfermot in the west of the city.
OL,12, One man is being questioned.
OL,23,V]DFrom 18-09-95   teletextarchive.com
